{"item_uid": "學測98-math-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔55分）", "stem": "甲、乙、丙三所高中的一年級分別有 3、4、5 個班級。從這 12 個班級中隨機選取一班參加國\n文抽考，再從未被抽中的 11 個班級中隨機選取一班參加英文抽考。則參加抽考的兩個班級在\n同一所學校的機率最接近以下哪個選項？\n(1) 21% (2) 23% (3) 25% (4) 27% (5) 29%\n-1-\n98年學測 第 2 頁\n數學考科 共 7 頁", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "5", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 10.0, "2": 20.0, "3": 11.0, "4": 16.0, "5": 42.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 4.0, "2": 5.0, "3": 3.0, "4": 8.0, "5": 80.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 14.0, "2": 35.0, "3": 21.0, "4": 22.0, "5": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 80.0, "p_low": 8.0, "discrimination": 72.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 64.0, 38.0, 16.0, 5.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
