{"item_uid": "學測98-math-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔55分）", "stem": "坐標平面上四條直線L,L ,L ,L 與x軸、 y軸及直線y = x的相關位置如圖所示，其\n1 2 3 4\n中L 與L 垂直，而L 與L 平行。設L,L ,L ,L 的方程式分別為y = m x, y = m x,\n1 3 3 4 1 2 3 4 1 2\ny =m x以及 y = m x+c。試問下列哪些選項是正確的？\n3 4\ny\n(1) m >m >m\n3 2 1 L\nL 2\n(2) m ⋅m =−1 1\n1 4\ny=x\n(3) m <−1\n1\nL 3\n(4) m ⋅m <−1\n2 3 L\n4\n(5) c>0\nx", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "2,3,4", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 27.0, "2": 79.0, "3": 73.0, "4": 69.0, "5": 32.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 7.0, "2": 97.0, "3": 91.0, "4": 85.0, "5": 10.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 47.0, "2": 59.0, "3": 58.0, "4": 53.0, "5": 50.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 46.0, "p_high": 80.0, "p_low": 16.0, "discrimination": 64.0, "p_quintiles": [86.0, 66.0, 42.0, 24.0, 13.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測98-math-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔55分）", "stem": "某廠商委託民調機構在甲、乙兩地調查聽過某項產品的居民佔當地居民之百分比(以下簡稱為\n「知名度」)。結果如下：在95%信心水準之下，該產品在甲、乙兩地的知名度之信賴區間分\n別為 [ 0.50 , 0.58 ]、[ 0.08 , 0.16 ]。試問下列哪些選項是正確的？\n(1) 甲地本次的參訪者中，54%的人聽過該產品\n(2) 此次民調在乙地的參訪人數少於在甲地的參訪人數\n(3) 此次調查結果可解讀為：甲地全體居民中有一半以上的人聽過該產品的機率大於95%\n(4) 若在乙地以同樣方式進行多次民調，所得知名度有95%的機會落在區間[ 0.08 , 0.16 ]\n(5) 經密集廣告宣傳後，在乙地再次進行民調，並增加參訪人數達原人數的四倍，則在95%\n信心水準之下該產品的知名度之信賴區間寬度會減半(即0.04)\n x+2y+az=1\n", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "1,2", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 67.0, "2": 38.0, "3": 57.0, "4": 75.0, "5": 41.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 80.0, "2": 34.0, "3": 55.0, "4": 85.0, "5": 48.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 51.0, "2": 45.0, "3": 59.0, "4": 63.0, "5": 38.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 7.0, "p_high": 6.0, "p_low": 7.0, "discrimination": -1.0, "p_quintiles": [7.0, 6.0, 7.0, 7.0, 7.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測98-math-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔55分）", "stem": "設a,b,c為實數，下列有關線性方程組3x+4y+bz=−1的敘述哪些是正確的？\n 2x+10y+7z=c\n(1) 若此線性方程組有解，則必定恰有一組解\n(2) 若此線性方程組有解，則11a−3b≠7\n(3) 若此線性方程組有解，則c=14\n(4) 若此線性方程組無解，則11a−3b=7\n(5) 若此線性方程組無解，則 c≠14\n-3-\n98年學測 第 4 頁\n數學考科 共 7 頁", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "4,5", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 56.0, "2": 60.0, "3": 55.0, "4": 58.0, "5": 46.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 49.0, "2": 66.0, "3": 47.0, "4": 69.0, "5": 50.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 58.0, "2": 54.0, "3": 59.0, "4": 48.0, "5": 41.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 8.0, "p_high": 11.0, "p_low": 7.0, "discrimination": 4.0, "p_quintiles": [15.0, 5.0, 6.0, 8.0, 6.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
